Package: miLineage
Type: Package
Title: Association Tests for Microbial Lineages on a Taxonomic Tree
Version: 4.0
Date: 2024-05-09
Author: Zheng-Zheng Tang
Maintainer: Zheng-Zheng Tang <tang@biostat.wisc.edu>
Description: A variety of association tests for microbiome data analysis including the Quasi-Conditional Association Tests (QCAT) described in Tang Z.-Z. et al.(2017) <doi:10.1093/bioinformatics/btw804>, QCAT-C for clustered microbiome data analysis described in Tang Z.-Z. & Chen G. (2019, Statistics in Biosciences), the Zero-Inflated Generalized Dirichlet Multinomial (ZIGDM) tests described in Tang Z.-Z. & Chen G. (2019) <Biostatistics, kxy025>, and the Adaptively Zero-Inflated Generalized Dirichlet Multinomial (AIGDM) tests for clustered microbiome data described in Hong Q. & Tang Z.-Z. (2024) <Submitted>.
License: GPL (>=2)
Depends: R (>= 3.1.1), MASS, data.table, geepack, abind, CompQuadForm
RoxygenNote: 7.1.1
NeedsCompilation: no
Packaged: 2024-07-25 06:59:47 UTC; 20172
